  {
    "index": 3,
    "hash": "d/NZWust/Z1z5f9IFqDeDaqpkFU=",
    "timestampUtcMs": "2026-08-16T20:32:42.805Z",
    "action": {
      "type": "SET_CONTENT",
      "input": {
        "content": "## Claim\n\nProvenance over ephemeral artifacts is not enough when skills write into persistent memory the human treats as their own thinking.\n\nThree contaminations follow:\n\n1. **Authorship erosion** \u2014 cannot tell human notes from skill drafts months later\n2. **Confidence laundering** \u2014 low-confidence agent claims land as flat facts and get cited as prior\n3. **Reflexive contamination** \u2014 later skills read agent-authored vault text as if it were human prior thinking\n\n## Remedy direction\n\nForce typed epistemic standing at write time (author, producer skill, epistemic mode, confidence, sources, review status) so the vault stays queryable along *mine vs agent* axes.",
        "updatedAt": "2026-08-16T20:32:42.805Z"
      },
      "timestampUtcMs": "2026-08-16T20:32:42.805Z"
    }
  },
